title The fusion lands scoped -- the roster learns to reprove only what moved, proven from both sides
prompt Keaton's kg opened the ranked crux: the fusion build, the 20-minute re-verify tax every rebased send pays. Design 20260825-173153; the skip word given 20260828.
think Two measurements decided the shape before a line was written. The hit-rate ledger read 17 matches in 106 opens -- 16 percent, today's tail all misses under the fleet's tempo -- which fires Move 2's own falsifier for the whole-digest skip and validates the diff-based synthesis instead: a scoped pass needs no matching digest, only a basis to diff from. And the scopability survey of all 111 rostered guards read 59 static, 41 discovery, 11 env -- with seven of the top eight heavies static, caravan_suite alone 8m31s of the lap tier scoped to four rooms. The discovery guards are nearly all seconds-class: a one-to-two-minute always-run floor.
think The build, in the runner's own idioms: --scoped joins standing_equipment_run.sh behind three walls (no composition with --all or a bare name; an outright refusal without a FULL receipt carrying a head this repository holds; and a scoped close NEVER writes the receipt -- a skip must never become the basis of the next skip, and the survey also caught a single-guard green overwriting the full record, closed by the same scope field). The receipt molts to v2 with head, scope, and tier, written by full passes alone. The changed set is basis-head to HEAD plus every porcelain path; the map is a curated tracked fixture (standing_equipment_scope_map.sh, 56 rows, the build edge -- rye, rishi source and binary, the copy shim, the toolchain -- spelled once and expanded onto 24 build-class rows; three rows I could not source-verify were dropped rather than guessed, since absence RUNS: a guard the map does not know is never skipped). Matching is per-changed-path shell-glob, so a room watches with a trailing slash and a scattered family with a star.
think Proven from both sides in the control's own pen idiom, seven new cases: no-basis refuses by verdict name; the full close writes head and scope; a watched edit runs the guard; an unwatched edit skips it BY NAME against a named basis; the scoped close withholds the receipt with its bytes proven unmoved; an unmapped guard always runs. The first run of the skip case failed honestly -- the pen's own untracked scaffolding rode the porcelain into the changed set and roster.kyri is watched -- fixed by committing the scaffolding as a real tree would. The witness gains the seven asserts; the full control answers zero no. The witness's roster half stays red on this bench by the STANDING state alone: runs_red=4 are the recorded rows for the gated reds (rule_twin at gate %7, width on another body's lap), the same reads Hush reported from the pier, untouched by this lap and unowned by it. A roster duplicate found by the survey (counsel_census rostered twice) also left, the commented record kept.
obs Mystery's first flight ended exactly as its law intends, carried in the reply: it took real work, met gate %7 -- the rule-twin reconciliation, genuinely Keaton's -- wrote CUSTODY naming the choice, held the circuit through every relaunch, and named its next admissible doorway. The resume is one hand-clear of the CUSTODY file; the gate-7 answer is his, with a designed middle (authorize the strictly-additive-one-side pairs mechanically, keep two-way divergences at the gate) surfaced as the option worth a word.
loom hit_rate=17/106 static=59 discovery=41 env=11 map_rows=56 build_edge_rows=24 control_new_cases=7 control_no=0 caravan_lap_return=8m31s
